- View appointments assigned to them.
- Accept or reject appointments assigned to them.
- Access authorized patient information.
- View consultation records they are permitted to access.
- View relevant emergency alerts.

Doctors must not access unrelated patient medical records.

### Important Security Rules

- Never trust role information submitted from the browser.
- Do not allow users to update their own role.
- Do not allow users to approve themselves as verified doctors.
- Use protected database functions or administrative server-side operations for privileged tasks.
- Use `auth.uid()` in RLS policies.
- Prevent unauthorized access to diagnostic reports and medical documents.
- Apply appropriate RLS and Storage policies.

Provide complete SQL policies.

